This crate's history score, bookmark relevance and search-suggestion relevance follow constants and formulas
from the Chromium omnibox (components/omnibox/browser/scored_history_match.cc, omnibox_field_trial.cc,
history_url_provider.cc, bookmark_provider.cc, scoring_functor.cc, search_provider.cc, search_suggestion_parser.cc,
url_prefix.cc, autocomplete_result.cc), read at chromium/chromium e9a46735de970a8e31217f2233efa3a47a1c337d.
The code is written anew in Rust; the numbers and formulas are Chromium's.

The unfocused address display in src/display.rs follows the elision rules and flag behaviour of the same Chromium revision
(components/omnibox/browser/location_bar_model_impl.cc, components/url_formatter/url_formatter.h and .cc,
components/url_formatter/elide_url.cc, chrome/browser/ui/views/omnibox/omnibox_view_views.cc), read at that same revision.
Behaviour, layout order and comments-as-specification only: no code and no table of numbers was copied from these files.

